{
  "title": "Kissed Greek Monkfish Skewers",
  "description": "These grilled monkfish skewers are glazed with a jammy honey‑yogurt sauce that turns glassy and glossy. A Greek‑inspired dish that dazzles with its savory sweetness.",
  "cuisine": "Greek",
  "diet": [
    "pescetarian"
  ],
